<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Morgan cuts Proton forecast.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Morgan cuts Proton forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it had cut its earnings per share forecast for Perusahaan Otomobil Nasional Bhd (Proton) by 10 percent for 1998 and 16 percent for 1999, downgrading the stock from buy to market performer.</p>
<p>The Malaysian car maker has been suffering at the expense of other models such as Satria and Kancil, Morgan said. It is now looking for EPS of 1.48 ringgit in 1998 and 1.66 in 1999.</p>
<p>-- Ben Hirschler, London newsroom +44 171 542 6414</p>
